Hi Sian
I'm not convinced this is anything more than random variation. The seed is set once for each call to run.scenarios, so the random number stream for the 8x8 grid is different in the two examples. If you do get 'consistent results when running it multiple times', enough to squeeze out the variance, then we have a problem. Come back on this if you have the evidence to prove me wrong!
Murray

